{"fiche":"PRELEVEMENT","contenus":[{"id":"5fff5a2b-9a0a-4de8-a57c-e9f06d45c4d8","racine_id":"5fff5a2b-9a0a-4de8-a57c-e9f06d45c4d8","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Friction hydro-alcoolique des mains","resume":"Avant et après chaque soin, après le retrait des gants.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Retirer bagues, montre et bracelets ; ongles courts, sans vernis.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Déposer une dose de solution hydro-alcoolique qui remplit le creux de la main.","vigilance":"Mains visiblement souillées : lavage au savon doux d'abord, séchage complet, puis friction."},{"texte":"Frictionner paume contre paume, puis le dos de chaque main, doigts entrecroisés.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Frictionner le dos des doigts, les pouces, puis le bout des doigts et les ongles dans la paume opposée.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Terminer par les poignets ; frictionner jusqu'à séchage complet, sans essuyer.","vigilance":"Une friction trop courte (moins de 20 à 30 secondes) laisse des zones non désinfectées."}],"materiel":["Solution hydro-alcoolique (flacon de poche)"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","le":"2026-11-10T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-11-10","revision_le":"2027-11-10"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"fc6427a0-a5e3-447b-9e88-9994e0bdc470","racine_id":"fc6427a0-a5e3-447b-9e88-9994e0bdc470","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Prélèvement veineux à domicile : bonnes pratiques","resume":"De l'identification du patient au dépôt au laboratoire.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Vérifier l'identité du patient et l'ordonnance ; contrôler les conditions demandées (à jeun, horaire, traitement pris ou non).","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Préparer les tubes du laboratoire destinataire et vérifier leur date de péremption.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Hygiène des mains, garrot posé moins d'une minute, antisepsie du point de ponction.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Remplir les tubes dans l'ordre recommandé par le laboratoire ; retourner doucement chaque tube.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Étiqueter les tubes au domicile, devant le patient, avant de partir.","vigilance":"Un tube non étiqueté ou mal identifié est refusé : jamais d'étiquetage différé dans la voiture."},{"texte":"Compléter la fiche de prélèvement (heure, préleveur) ; respecter délai et température de transport.","vigilance":"Délai et température d'acheminement : se référer au manuel de prélèvement du laboratoire."}],"materiel":["Tubes et corps de prélèvement","Garrot","Antiseptique et compresses","Collecteur à aiguilles","Boîte de transport"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PRELEVEMENT"],"tags":["pré-analytique","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","le":"2026-11-07T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Jean Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-11-07","revision_le":"2027-11-07"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":3,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"0b6f035f-4f94-4d75-8ab2-06572d565256","racine_id":"0b6f035f-4f94-4d75-8ab2-06572d565256","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La friction hydro-alcoolique, comment ?","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:30","credit":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"IXiGWkMu27E"},"source":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-06T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-06","revision_le":"2027-11-06"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"20ff243a-e0f2-4b00-9e87-53a57090ed26","racine_id":"20ff243a-e0f2-4b00-9e87-53a57090ed26","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Les bonnes pratiques du prélèvement biologique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"5:51","credit":"CHA · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"6hah8g_MN68"},"source":"CHA","fiches":["PRELEVEMENT"],"tags":["pré-analytique","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-13T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-13","revision_le":"2027-10-13"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":3,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"e63cba94-dc21-4487-9acd-c8d075bfe1da","racine_id":"e63cba94-dc21-4487-9acd-c8d075bfe1da","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:05","credit":"Gustave Roussy · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"_MtZJsdr824"},"source":"Gustave Roussy","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-03T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-03","revision_le":"2027-11-03"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"21ad15db-0953-4c2a-ba68-d4a4ad53e033","racine_id":"21ad15db-0953-4c2a-ba68-d4a4ad53e033","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"2:00","credit":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"KFK7f8IMGe8"},"source":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-31T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-31","revision_le":"2027-10-31"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"eaf0da53-6184-42bd-b820-0ff9343cf1ac","racine_id":"eaf0da53-6184-42bd-b820-0ff9343cf1ac","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Quelle hygiène des mains entre deux soins chez le même patient ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-11-10T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-11-10","revision_le":"2027-11-10"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"6637fc75-1ca9-47c7-b4f5-f3ba766ae466","texte":"Friction hydro-alcoolique avant et après chaque soin, y compris chez le même patient quand on passe d'un site contaminé (change, plaie) à un site propre (injection, cathéter), et après le retrait des gants. Lavage au savon doux seulement si les mains sont visiblement souillées, puis friction une fois les mains sèches.","source":"SF2H, bonnes pratiques en soins de ville, 2015","auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Dr Jean Marchand, Médecin","validee_le":"2026-11-10"}]},{"id":"64d9adec-b249-4120-85bb-c3cadffb35e0","racine_id":"64d9adec-b249-4120-85bb-c3cadffb35e0","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Bonnes pratiques essentielles en hygiène en soins de ville","resume":null,"corps":{"url":"https://www.sf2h.net/k-stock/data/uploads/2015/11/SF2H_recommandations_bonnes-pratiques-essentielles-en-hygiene-a-l-usage-des-professionnels-de-sante-en-soins-de-ville-2015.pdf"},"source":"SF2H, 2015","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-11-18T07:42:38.986047+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-29T17:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-29","revision_le":"2027-10-29"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":0,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"ca812c1b-2313-458f-bce0-f26c5a4ebfd2","racine_id":"ca812c1b-2313-458f-bce0-f26c5a4ebfd2","version":1,"type":"document","titre":"Hygiène des mains"